# Keep the image to the package itself.
#
# Tests and smoke scripts are deliberately excluded: they are the gate you run
# before building, not cargo to ship into a production image. Shipping them
# would also put `AIBANK_ALLOW_DEV_SECRETS` usage examples inside the
# container, which is exactly the wrong thing to have lying around.
.git
.gitignore
.env
.env.example
tests/
scripts/
deploy/
compose.yaml
Dockerfile
README.md
LICENSE
e2e.sh
run_demo_server.py
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
